{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-10_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-10","title":"相逢，總是離別","storyCode":"R8-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ce4b36b52035ffeeaefa4fc0fc9668833259deb9a7109a8145b12d59cf21f3eb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"得知糾察隊位於西邊，阿麗娜前往東邊村子交換物資。在她走後，塔露拉收到有過交易的西邊村子正遭搜查的消息，決定伏擊糾察隊。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"暉潔：\n我不知道我還要走多遠。\n我偶爾會聽見冬羽們清脆的叫聲，那代表什麼？是不是說春天快來了？\n雖然還是很冷，但天氣轉暖的日子應該不遠了。\n經過三個星期，我們終於又找到了兩個願意和感染者交換物資的村莊。\n在離他們幾公里外的廢棄聚居地，我們紮了營，那有不少燃料，能讓我們支撐一段時間。\n樹根實在不好吃。不想再聽老爺子說什麼“很有營養”之類了。\n12月7日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這條路通向什麼地方，我是清楚的。\n那個終點我們必須走到，就算我走不到，葉蓮娜，阿麗娜，還有伊諾他們......也應該能走到。\n只是我們腳下的路，實在太不分明了。\n他們會拒絕我們嗎？我們不能給他們太多幻想。\n許一個沒法兌現的諾言是種壞事，烏薩斯帝國對麵包和被褥的許諾，只是掩蓋了他們的暴行與謊言。欺騙就是另一種統治的開始。\n他們會厭惡我們嗎？很可能。如果不是因為北原上的人民過得都很苦，很多人看見感染者就會向糾察隊舉報。\n這種惡意可能是來自他們對於自己處境的擔憂......\n我和博卓卡斯替不一樣。我們要防範這些，但這絕對不會是什麼他們“骨子裡的東西”。\n我們不能因為這些趨利避害的行為就去恨他們。絕對不可以。\n他們會傷害我們嗎？這我就不太清楚了。我也許不能考慮太多......\n不管怎麼說......我認為，許多人是被逼著變成那樣的。\n如果有阿麗娜那樣的老師在，有我們的隊伍在，有感染者和普通人的和平共處在......他們會被改變。\n許多人只是被烏薩斯灌注了太多被歪曲過的觀念而已。我們可以幫助他們，知識能夠改變人的想法。\n只不過，這真的很難。即使我相信......在行動中貫徹一種有力的信念，讓真相為所有人接受，這本應是最基本的。\n【上面的話語都被劃去了。當然，信件從來沒被寄出去過。】"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"現在出去會不會有些危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我問過戰士們，糾察隊應該都聚在西邊的村子吧？前幾天你們和他們的交流是不是被發現了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"有這個可能。所以，暫時別往西邊去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，那東邊這個村子，應該還是可以換些東西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，別太擔心，我們以前遇到的情況可比這危險多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你準備去換些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"罐裝水果和乾蔬果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......好像不是特別重要的東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"再這樣下去戰士們會得病的。你也多學點生活方面的常識吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"填飽肚子都很困難了，有些東西大概真不是那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，塔露拉，這可不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"“正因為我們有時候吃不飽也穿不暖，所以那些詩歌、音樂、果實、鮮花，對味覺、視覺和嗅覺、觸覺的渴望，才是可貴的。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"“就是這些東西提醒著我們，我們是在為了讓所有人過上什麼樣的生活而奮鬥的。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"健康的身體當然也是其中一部分。一點點蔬果就能讓許多人都擺脫疾病了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......用我的說法反駁我，很狡詐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼呀......狡詐是什麼詞啊，不應該哦塔露拉同學。請跟我說，聰——明——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"好好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"需要人保護你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不太好。我又不是什麼特別的感染者，因為我讓我們暴露蹤跡可不好。而且，我是比較容易隱藏自己身份的感染者，其他的戰士們可不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那注意安全。那些村民也沒那麼值得信任......出爾反爾的事情發生過太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好。噢，我會多換點梨的。雪怪們會不會更喜歡蘋果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"他們好像更喜歡山莓......就別管他們了吧。他們找那些有自己那一套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有個會要開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我走啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——阿麗娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"之後我準備組織一個感染者教育小組，你想當組長嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"在那些不是戰士的感染者裡，你的名聲可比我要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候也比較容易向大家介紹你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"知識的戰士也是戰士，阿麗娜。這點我會堅持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"看你安排吧。不會要寫演講辭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我彷彿已經聽到掌聲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......別揶揄我了。我去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。早點回來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"這不行。必須直接吊死他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"大尉他現在不在，如果他在這，一定會立刻這麼下令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"遊擊隊的戰士，我們不是軍隊，至少現在還不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"影響太差了。他們本因為信任我們而加入我們，然後因為饑餓而產生懷疑，最後犯下錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是，我們根本沒能兌現承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"承諾讓他們吃我們本就沒剩下多少的食物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們承諾能讓感染者有容身之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要指望所有人都是為了崇高的目的來到這裡的。這不現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們早點交付那批機器得到這些糧食，就能增加他們的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何我不同意他們繼續留在我們的隊伍之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那就流放他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不准使用額外的暴力，而且，給他們一周的口糧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能！我們的戰士都沒有這個待遇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"這點我們絕不會退讓。不是因為功績什麼的，而是因為他們的作為根本不配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。那麼，言語別太激烈。別過度斥責他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......最多就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"西邊既然已經有糾察隊在活動......那就不能讓他們發現這些感染者的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣應該把他們丟在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？有人敲門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"是糾察隊！他們在搜查和我們交易了糧食的那個村莊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"現在撤退嗎？我們現在撤走的話，等他們發現我們的蹤跡，我們早就走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"把糾察隊引過來。我們在這附近伏擊他們，即使要留下痕跡，我們也應該讓糾察隊認為這些是我們做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！再想想！十公里之內就是第四集團軍的崗哨，一旦糾察隊報信，他們也會出動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這兩個村莊因為包庇我們而被洗劫......不，不包庇我們也沒用，只要他們因為感染者而受害，就不會再有村子會願意和我們交換物資了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那把消息截住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這種想法會讓消息傳得更遠，更惡劣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好，如果你殺了人去掩蓋，那麼屍體就是新的證據；如果你毀屍滅跡，那麼空白就是證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"想讓壞事不要在人和人之間流傳，辦法只有一個，那就是別讓壞事發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在要做的是拓寬我們的道路，以及願意繼續走下去的後人的路。還有問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的也有道理，就這麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你剛才說的是對的。保護好非戰鬥人員，幫助他們先撤走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有場硬仗要打。這回我和你們一起打這場，而且我們的身邊，沒有霜星，也沒有愛國者；記住，有一天，你們身邊可能甚至沒有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但只要一件事是對的、是可行的，我們身邊並不需要任何人。你們並不需要任何人在身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
